{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"一、十有二年。春王三月，莒人伐我東鄙，圍臺。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"邑不言圍，此其言圍何？伐而言圍者，取邑之辭也；伐而不言圍者，非取邑之辭也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"二、季孫宿帥師救臺，遂入運。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"大夫無遂事，此其言遂何？公不得為政爾。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"三、夏，晉侯使士彭來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"四、秋九月，吳子乘卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"五、冬，楚公子貞帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_161_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_161","textTraditional":"六、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}